flowchart TD
    P[Coordinator and Researcher preparation] --> R[Independent review + hash-bound release]
    R --> G[User activation + verified project snapshot]
    G --> I[Implementer: discovery / Ansible build / authorized apply / receipts]
    I --> O[Durable review-ready outbox]
    O --> E[Evaluator: source and evidence review]
    E -->|scoped feedback| I
    E -->|unchanged waiting| H[Hold for new evidence or user decision]
    H --> I
    E -->|all S1-S6 verified| D[Whole-campaign sign-off and owner closeout]
    I -->|bounded knowledge gap| Q[Request with campaign ID and return-to]
    E -->|bounded knowledge gap| Q
    Q --> P
    P -->|separate response; preserve upstream snapshot| B{Request return-to role}
    B -->|Implementer| I
    B -->|Evaluator| E
    V[Read-only Observer] -. artifacts .-> O
    V -. verdicts .-> E
    V -. optional named runtime snapshot .-> X[One parent chat / implementation runner / dashboard]
    X -. reports progress directly .-> U[User stays in parent chat]
    X -. owns wakeups, not role judgment .-> I
    X -. owns wakeups, not role judgment .-> E
